<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CCITTModifiedHuffman> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One-dimensional CCITT T.4 run-length coding of bilevel rows without EOL codes, each row starting on a byte (rowAlignment 8, TIFF compression 2) or 16-bit word (rowAlignment 16, TIFF compression 32771) boundary, decoded with libtiff's recovery rules. Output: rows of ceil(columns / 8) bytes, most significant bit first, 1 for black."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CCITTModifiedHuffman> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CCITTModifiedHuffman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CCITT Modified Huffman"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CCITTModifiedHuffman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding> .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CIELabToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Converts 8-bit CIE L*a*b* samples to sRGB as libtiff's TIFFCIELabToRGB does for the given white point (D50 by default); alpha appends an opaque fourth band."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CIELabToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CIELabToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CIE L*a*b* to RGB"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CIELabToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding> .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CMYKToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Converts 8-bit CMYK (InkSet 1) samples to RGB as libtiff's RGBA interface does: each channel is (255 - K) x (255 - C/M/Y) / 255; alpha appends an opaque fourth band."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CMYKToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
