<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Gzip> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Identifier for gzip-framed compressed data, distinct from an unwrapped DEFLATE bitstream."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Gzip> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
