<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#JPEG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "ITU-T T.81 baseline, extended (12-bit) and progressive Huffman-coded JPEG, decoded with libjpeg's integer IDCT and upsampling. tables supplies an abbreviated table-specification stream (TIFF JPEGTables) kept in the session for every later image; colorTransform ycbcr-to-rgb converts as libjpeg does; rows stops after that many rows; output raw-planes returns the component planes before upsampling and conversion."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#JPEG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
