<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#SGILogRLE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding> .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Shuffle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reversible transform grouping corresponding bytes of successive fixed-width values to prepare them for compression."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Shuffle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
