<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#TransformScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Format-neutral byte and sample transforms a pipeline step can apply: predictors, bit reversal, colour conversions and array filters."@en .
