<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Converts 8-bit YCbCr samples to RGB with libtiff's integer tables (tif_color.c) for the given coefficients and reference black/white. layout pixels takes three interleaved samples per pixel; units takes TIFF YCbCr sampling units (subsampling luma samples then Cb and Cr); planes takes the three component planes of a raw JPEG decode."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
